# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore. The build context is the PARENT directory of
# fathom/ and filo/ (see Dockerfile) — whitelist only what the build needs.
*
!fathom/mix.exs
!fathom/mix.lock
!fathom/config
!fathom/lib
!fathom/priv
!fathom/assets
# The release's vm.args template. Omitting it does not fail the build — `mix release` just
# generates a default vm.args — so the VM flags vanish silently. Keep this whitelisted.
!fathom/rel
!filo
filo/_build
filo/deps
filo/.git
filo/erl_crash.dump
fathom/priv/static/assets
